    "guide.privacy.branding1": "{app} reads very little, keeps it on this machine, blacks out anything that looks like a key, and answers to no one but you.",
    "guide.privacy.branding2": "A search engine over your own folders sees a great deal that was never meant to be published. {app} is built so that the index holds as little as it needs, and so that the little it holds never leaves the room.",
